{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Speak Emoji 是一款讓幼兒透過點按表情圖案學習說話的互動遊戲，適合兩歲左右、尚未識字的小朋友使用；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-254.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>點按表情互動學習</h2>\n<p>小朋友點按表情圖案，圖案會放大、跳舞，裝置同時讀出名稱，涵蓋動物、食物、車輛等並支援 113 種語言。介面為兩歲幼兒而設，毋須閱讀；小外星人圖示可進入十一款互動小遊戲，家長設定隱藏於幼兒難以回答的問題後，可選擇起始語言及查看防止離開 App 的指南。遊戲無廣告、帳戶與網絡連線，不收集資料。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-186-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-187-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-188-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-189-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-190-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-191-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Speak Emoji</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/speak-emoji/id6816439491?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T18:44:23.757184+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T18:30:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T13:57:43.467412+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:37:53.059605+00:00","content_hash":"cf78cc01b55c4e8a17feee5da93d267c67dd417beb061c492e6ba8d7ec5fae9d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}